From a70b19e39d800621d307a858d1f5ca2bb9fca03c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vadik likholetov <vadikas@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:30:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] KVM: arm64: port Android pKVM device assignment

Port the Android 17 6.18 protected-device framework to Linux 7.1.7. Include the EL2 IOMMU allocator and pvIOMMU protocol, host KVM and VFIO routing, guest pvIOMMU frontend, and protected VFIO IOMMU support.\n\nKeep the framework built in and vendor-neutral. Hardware IOMMU ownership and device reset remain the responsibility of a platform backend.
